WEBVTT

00:00:26.153 --> 00:00:29.313
I don't think you'll get back in that way.
我不认为你能从那儿回去

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:35.113
You see, I've already tried.
你知道 我早就试过了

00:00:38.873 --> 00:00:40.633
Will we ever go back?
我们还会再回去吗？

00:00:40.793 --> 00:00:42.473
Oh, I expect so.
哦 我希望如此

00:00:43.713 --> 00:00:47.393
But it'll probably happen
when you're not looking for it.
但是 如果你不去找它
也许它自会出现

00:00:49.153 --> 00:00:50.713
All the same,
不管怎样…

00:00:50.913 --> 00:00:53.193
best to keep your eyes open.
…最好还是时刻留心

00:01:02.593 --> 00:01:04.513
(ASLAN ROARING)

00:01:55.753 --> 00:01:57.553
(WUNDERKIND PLAYING)

00:05:27.633 --> 00:05:29.913
(WINTER LIGHT PLAYING)
[BODY]

